error[8-0110]: cannot write to `s`, which a closure captures
   ┌─ known_product_capture.fe:56:17
   │
56 │         let (a, mut b) = s
   │                 ^^^^^ the closure only reads its copy
   │
   = closures capture by copy or move; thread state through parameters and results instead

